OL,3,GNEWSAMP opposing data centre joins
OL,4,Agovernment committee
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut despite being critical of the bid,
OL,7,FGoldsborough insists he is not at odds
OL,8,Fwith his own government's stance on the
OL,9,Fissue, which wants them built to "power
OL,10,Fthe age of AI".
